<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor33eae528-b75a-40c5-a1b1-ca00a87f9b21" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p><span data-teams="true" data-pasted="true"></span></p><h2 class="subhead1"><span style="font-size: inherit;"><strong>Public Notice</strong></span></h2><p><span style="font-size: inherit;">Notice is hereby given that effective January 1, 2026, in accordance with Texas Election Code Chapter 42, the Williamson County Elections Department has implemented changes to Williamson County&rsquo;s existing Voting Precincts for compliance with the Texas Congressional District boundaries as passed in the 2025 Legislature (PlanC2333). These changes were adopted by Commissioners Court on October 28, 2025.</span><span style="font-size: inherit;"></span><br></p><p></p>
    </div>

